1
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:03,600
(Sheldon:)Specifically, how would the Civil War
have gone differently...

2
00:00:03,768 --> 00:00:06,358
(Sheldon:)...if Lincoln had been
a robot sent from the future?

3
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:14,736
(Sheldon:)Look at that, there's even pasta left over.

4
00:00:15,196 --> 00:00:17,826
(Leonard:)Do you understand
that this was supposed to be a date?

5
00:00:17,991 --> 00:00:19,531
(Sheldon:)I do. Do you?

6
00:00:19,701 --> 00:00:22,831
(Sheldon:)Because, frankly, you've been
in a foul mood since I sat down.

7
00:00:26,249 --> 00:00:28,249
Okay, here's my question:

8
00:00:28,418 --> 00:00:30,588
(Leonard:)Why did you sit down?

9
00:00:31,254 --> 00:00:34,424
(Sheldon:)To help.
Look, if you fail at this relationship...

10
00:00:34,591 --> 00:00:36,381
(Sheldon:)...and history suggests you will...

11
00:00:37,927 --> 00:00:42,517
(Sheldon:)...then we risk losing the medical officer
that our landing party has always needed.

12
00:00:45,185 --> 00:00:47,685
(Leonard:)What landing party?

13
00:00:48,271 --> 00:00:50,731
(Sheldon:)You're Kirk. I'm Spock.
Wolowitz is Scotty.

14
00:00:50,899 --> 00:00:53,819
(Sheldon:)Koothrappali is the guy
who always gets killed.

15
00:00:55,737 --> 00:01:05,027
(Sheldon:)And now we've got McCoy.

